{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1293572","title":"Tree species and urban green space types jointly drive rhizosphere SOC fractionation and stability via microbial-enzymatic pathways","description":"Soil organic carbon (SOC) dynamics in urban ecosystems are critically influenced by vegetation-microbe interactions, yet how tree functional types and green space management jointly regulate rhizosphere SOC fractionation and stability remains poorly understood. Here, we investigated the divergent effects of two native tree species across four urban green space types (urban parks, residential areas, roadside shelterbelts, and suburban forests) on rhizosphere SOC stabilization pathways.","center":"Beijing Forestry University","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2025/07/19 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN50025683","Metagenome or environmental sample from metagenome","uncertain",null,null,2024,"CN","Beijing",1816670,"Beijing","verified",39.88,116.37,"China:Beijing","rhizosphere soil",null,null,null,"conflicting evidence: environmental and host/clinical"],["SAMN50025684","Metagenome or environmental sample from metagenome","uncertain",null,null,2024,"CN","Beijing",1816670,"Beijing","verified",39.88,116.37,"China:Beijing","rhizosphere soil",null,null,null,"conflicting evidence: environmental and host/clinical"],["SAMN50025685","Metagenome or environmental sample from metagenome","uncertain",null,null,2024,"CN","Beijing",1816670,"Beijing","verified",39.88,116.37,"China:Beijing","rhizosphere soil",null,null,null,"conflicting evidence: environmental and host/clinical"],["SAMN50025686","Metagenome or environmental sample from metagenome","uncertain",null,null,2024,"CN","Beijing",1816670,"Beijing","verified",39.92,116.4